msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"

msgid "| Configuration | Single Node | Prefill | Decode |"
msgstr "| 配置 | 单节点 | Prefill | Decode |"

msgid "| KV cache | FP8 | FP8 | FP8 |"
msgstr "| KV 缓存 | FP8 | FP8 | FP8 |"

msgid "| Graph mode | FULL_DECODE_ONLY | NONE | FULL_DECODE_ONLY |"
msgstr "| 图模式 | FULL_DECODE_ONLY | NONE | FULL_DECODE_ONLY |"

msgid "| Engram CPU offload | Enabled | Enabled | Enabled |"
msgstr "| Engram CPU 卸载 | 启用 | 启用 | 启用 |"

msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guidelines"
msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"

msgid ""
"Keep the `prefill` and `decode` topology declarations consistent in both "
"roles' `--kv-transfer-config`. For general tuning methods, refer to "
"[Optimization and "
"Tuning](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
msgstr ""
"确保两个角色的 `--kv-transfer-config` 中 `prefill` 和 `decode` "
"的拓扑声明保持一致。通用调优方法请参考[优化与调优](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid ""
"For common environment and installation issues, refer to the [Public "
"FAQs](../../faqs.md)."
msgstr "常见环境与安装问题请参考[公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)。"

msgid "### 10.1 Engram Tables Are Replicated Across Decode Ranks"
msgstr "### 10.1 Engram 表在各 Decode Rank 间被复制"

msgid "**Symptom:** Decode host-memory use increases when starting DP4."
msgstr "**现象：** 启动 DP4 时 Decode 主机内存占用增加。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Keep `\"cpu_offload\":true` and `\"dp_shared_memory\":true` "
"in the Decode `--engram-config`. Prefill uses DP1 and keeps "
"`\"dp_shared_memory\":false`, as shown in [Section 5.2](#52-pd-"
"disaggregation-1p1d)."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 在 Decode 的 `--engram-config` 中保留 `\"cpu_offload\":true` 和 "
"`\"dp_shared_memory\":true`。Prefill 使用 DP1 并保留 "
"`\"dp_shared_memory\":false`，如[第 5.2 节](#52-pd-disaggregation-1p1d)所示。"

msgid "### 10.2 Model Loading Is Still in Progress or Startup Fails"
msgstr "### 10.2 模型加载仍在进行中或启动失败"

msgid ""
"Follow `prefill.log` and `decode.log` while weights load and Decode graphs "
"are captured. Start the proxy after both services report `Application "
"startup complete` and their `/health` endpoints return `200`."
msgstr ""
"在权重加载和 Decode 图捕获期间，跟踪 `prefill.log` 和 `decode.log`。待两个服务均报告 `Application "
"startup complete` 且其 `/health` 端点返回 `200` 后，再启动代理。"

msgid ""
"If a service exits, inspect its first error and check the model/source "
"paths, visible NPUs, Engram configuration, and UB endpoint directory against"
" the corresponding role script."
msgstr "如果某个服务退出，请检查其首个错误，并对照相应角色的脚本检查模型/源路径、可见 NPU、Engram 配置和 UB 端点目录。"
